I just ascended Beavis the Wizard after a long, long battle with
Spork. I found it much harder than vanilla in several ways:

1. Wizards have a tough time casting spells when wearing body armor.
Sucks to be a wizard, sometimes. And they have to wear the Eye to get
fast power regeneration.
2. The magic missile attack does damage even if you have magic
resistance and reflection. Therefore Asmodeus and angels are very
dangerous foes. And Astral is hell.
3. It's completely impractical to use a weapon at unskilled.
4. No pudding farming.

I found running a wizard much more entertaining than the usual Vanilla
cakewalk. So if you're interested, that's my take.



